// slot 18: jurorStakes (mapping)

// cases[0] selectedJurors is at slot computed from:
// keccak256(keccak256(caseId . selectedJurors_slot . cases_slot)) + offset_in_array
// Actually for a mapping at slot 10 in the struct, the slot is:
